WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Russia is the world's largest country by land area, spanning eastern Europe and northern Asia across 11 time zones.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Mount Elbrus in the Caucasus range rises to 5,642 meters as the highest summit on the European continent.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Lake Baikal in Siberia is the world's deepest and oldest freshwater lake, holding 20% of unfrozen surface water.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Traditional folk costumes feature the Sarafan dress and the triangular three-string Balalaika instrument.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Culinary traditions feature beetroot Borscht soup served with sour cream and savory Pelmeni dumplings.

